WEBVTT

00:35:59.339 --> 00:36:03.115
That the things that were being done
were best for the collective,

00:36:03.139 --> 00:36:07.408
and kind of the rising tide
lifts all ships,

00:36:07.432 --> 00:36:10.447
and they can be a little bit
more conscious of the language.

00:36:10.471 --> 00:36:14.702
It still shows up as the "Is" and "mes,"

00:36:14.726 --> 00:36:19.275
but I think it's --

00:36:19.299 --> 00:36:21.189
it's easy to see in retrospect I guess.

00:36:21.213 --> 00:36:22.663
AG: Yeah.

00:36:22.687 --> 00:36:24.553
There's a spectrum of self-awareness

00:36:24.577 --> 00:36:27.249
when it comes to the most
selfish takers among us.

00:36:27.273 --> 00:36:29.339
And on one end you have people

00:36:29.363 --> 00:36:32.307
for whom it's a very
deliberate strategy, right?